== Good tools
- [https://www.proquest.com/ ProQuest]: find PHD thesis using name or title.
- [https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/find-by-topic/ MIT opencourse]: lecture notes
- [https://www.msri.org/workshops/809/schedules/ MSRI]: Mathematical Sciences Research Institute, workshop video
- [https://www.papersapp.com/features/ Papers]: Reference management applications 
- [https://simons.berkeley.edu/ Simons Institute]: Theoretical seminar for CS and STAT

== Recommended reading
. High dimension
  .. Martin Wainwright, High-Dimensional Statistics: A Non-Asymptotic Viewpoint.
  .. Philippe Rigollet and Jan-Christian Huetter, High Dimensional Statistics. [http://www-math.mit.edu/~rigollet/PDFs/RigNotes17.pdf  Lecture Notes]
  .. Roman Vershynin, [https://www.math.uci.edu/~rvershyn/papers/HDP-book/ High-Dimensional Probability: An Introduction with Applications in Data Science],\[[notes/HDPnotes.pdf notes]\]
  .. Ramon van Handel, [https://web.math.princeton.edu/~rvan/APC550.pdf Probability in High Dimension]
. Random matrix
  .. Terence Tao, Topics in random matrix theory 
  .. Jack William Silverstein and Zhidong Bai, Spectral Analysis of Large Dimensional Random Matrices
. Nonparametric
  .. Alexandre B. Tsybakov, Introduction to Nonparametric Estimation [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_hKD0gIc4_M6Lfrbj8BqjGeKviOmizxU?usp=sharing notes]
  .. Iain M. Johnstone, [http://statweb.stanford.edu/~imj/ Gaussian estimation: Sequence and wavelet models]
. Asymptotic
  .. Aad van der Vaart, Asymptotic Statistics




